Thu May 23 08:18:15 UTC 2024 - Dominique Leuenberger <dimstar@opensuse.org>

- No longer recommend tlp: we have three (conflicting) power tuners
  by now, each is recommended by some pattern/feature:
  + tuned is recommended by the base patterns (installed on all
    systems)
  + power-daemon-profiles is recommended by GNOME and Plasma (GUI
    controlled)
  + tlp recommended by laptop pattern (tlp conflicts explicitly
    with the other two though).

